# —— Music: this repo keeps audio libraries and downloads next to the code;
#    those are large binaries and shouldn't be version-controlled. Ignoring
#    the audio (and its sidecars) makes the mix/download folders drop out of
#    git status without enumerating each one. ——
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.wav
*.flac
*.ogg
*.oga
*.aiff
*.aif
*.wma
*.aac
*.asd
